	                   Month/Day/
	                   DayOfWeek/Hour/
	                   Minute            Real-world clock match; -1 =
	                                     any/wildcard for that field.
	                   ContinuanceTime   -1 = use the matching
	                                     <StateTime>'s duration instead.
	<StateTime>      One row per state (1-7, MAX_CRYWOLF_STATE):
	                   State    State number (matches
	                            eCrywolfState-style state ids).
	                   Hour/Minute/Second  How long that state lasts.
	<MonsterGroup>   Up to 20 (MAX_CRYWOLF_MONSTER_GROUP) AI group
