	                   Value
	<Boss>           Group/TurnUpTime - which AI group is the boss
	                 group, and how many seconds until it appears.
	<AIChange>       Time - seconds between monster AI behavior
	                 changes.
	<MVPScore>       Table1-7 - score awarded per MVP scoring category.
	<MVPRankScore>   Table1-5 - minimum score thresholds for MVP ranks
	                 1-5.
	<MVPRankExp>     Table1-5 - experience reward for each MVP rank.

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
